<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>ORE - Kiho - 150,000 tonnes ore Saldanha/Taranto $5.35 fio scale load/40,000 1-10/10 Italian charterers.</p>
<p>SKS Trust - 95,000 tonnes ore Tubarao/Dunkirk $6.65 fio six days shinc end Sep Coe and Clerici.</p>
</text>
